OL,3,GNEWSAFirst female junior jarl for
OL,4,AShetland's Up Helly Aa festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FShetland's world famous Up Helly Aa
OL,7,Ffire festival is to have its first
OL,8,Ffemale junior jarl.
OL,10,FErin Harries has been elected to the
OL,11,Frole of Viking chief for the youth
OL,12,Fsection of next year's celebrations in
OL,13,FLerwick.
OL,15,FThe 13-year-old said: "I'm still
OL,16,Fprocessing the news. I'm so excited."
OL,18,FJunior Up Helly Aa (JUHA) said Erin's
OL,19,Felection was a "historic moment" and
OL,20,Fshe would receive her jarl suit on Up
OL,21,FHelly Aa day on 26 January.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
